  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the South Asia Regional Training and Technical Assistance Centre (SARTTAC) - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;In Phase 2 of SARTTAC operations, capacity development will be tailored to support South Asia member countries in advancing economic policies and reform to address key macroeconomic challenges, preserve stability, and foster inclusive growth. SARTTAC will continue to deliver both training and TA activities, actively integrating and garnering synergies.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
